Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

It seems to me that with a single machine there are other options before you consider Hadoop hence RHadoop. But if you are developing with an eye on the future and you expect data sizes to go up and to be switching to  a cluster, then you may want to go with RHadoop right away. For string processing, it's possible in R but R is not the only option.

Antonio

